WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.413 --> 00:00:03.526
Unit five. Digital Footprint!

2
00:00:04.484 --> 00:00:09.120
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:12.044
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.094 --> 00:00:15.844
Today we learn about Digital Footprint. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.411 --> 00:00:22.205
Digital footprint. Say it with me. Digital footprint!

6
00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:29.486
Permanent. Say it with me. Permanent!

7
00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:36.700
Post. Say it with me. Post!

8
00:00:40.213 --> 00:00:45.135
Think before posting. Say it with me. Think before posting!

9
00:00:48.636 --> 00:00:53.236
Reputation. Say it with me. Reputation!

10
00:00:56.670 --> 00:01:01.337
Privacy setting. Say it with me. Privacy setting!

11
00:01:04.876 --> 00:01:08.707
Delete. Say it with me. Delete!

12
00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:16.755
Screenshot. Say it with me. Screenshot!

13
00:01:20.271 --> 00:01:36.532
Everything I post online becomes part of my digital footprint, which can feel almost permanent. I think before posting because it can affect my reputation later. Adjusting a privacy setting helps, but even a deleted post might live on as a screenshot.

14
00:01:36.582 --> 00:01:39.685
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:40.422 --> 00:01:45.739
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:45.789 --> 00:01:46.939
Post!

17
00:01:47.922 --> 00:01:53.299
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:53.349 --> 00:01:54.499
Delete!

19
00:01:55.444 --> 00:02:03.645
Did you know? Even a deleted post can sometimes still exist somewhere online, like in a saved screenshot!

20
00:02:03.695 --> 00:02:06.174
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:06.871 --> 00:02:16.140
Think and answer. Why should you think carefully before posting something online?

22
00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:17.340
Great answer!

23
00:02:18.241 --> 00:02:23.758
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:23.808 --> 00:02:27.010
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

